flowchart LR
    %% Artifact Data Flow — implementation authority:
    %% WORKFLOW.md, skills, task_graph.py, artifact_schema.py, and context_engine.py
    %% Palette: documents/diagrams/source/_shared/palette.md

    STATUS["status.md<br/>durable lifecycle and delivery profile"]:::core
    AN["analysis.md<br/>spec-research findings, risks, open questions"]:::core
    SP["spec.md<br/>requirements, ACs, invariants, non-goals"]:::core
    PL["plan.md<br/>technical design, boundaries, proof surfaces"]:::core
    TK["tasks.md<br/>T-NNN graph, AC links, status, proof<br/>tasks.json generated sidecar"]:::core
    CODE[("Project source + tests<br/>implementation changes")]:::gate
    PROOF["Fresh validation evidence<br/>task-done --evidence or existing proof"]:::decision
    REV["review.md<br/>mechanical results plus alignment,<br/>design, and security judgment"]:::gate

    AN -->|research evidence when needed| SP
    SP -->|requirements decomposition| PL
    PL -->|technical design and proof plan| TK
    TK -->|ready task scope| CODE
    CODE -->|local proof| PROOF
    PROOF -->|recorded against T-NNN| TK
    TK -->|AC links and completion proof| REV
    CODE -->|delivered behavior| REV

    STATUS -.->|phase updates by skills| AN
    STATUS -.->|phase updates by skills| SP
    STATUS -.->|phase updates by skills| PL
    STATUS -.->|phase updates by skills| REV

    SESSION[".corebase-specharness/sessions/&lt;slug&gt;/session.md<br/>objective, progress, and handoff updates"]:::optional
    PL -.->|checkpoint decisions and risks| SESSION
    SESSION -.->|read at next skill entry| CODE

    EXTRACT["artifacts/features/&lt;slug&gt;/session-extracts.md<br/>candidate lessons and ## Post-Ship Sync"]:::memory
    CODE -->|non-trivial candidate| EXTRACT
    REV -->|passing closeout requires sync heading| EXTRACT

    TRIAGE["/context-memory<br/>evidence-backed triage, promotion,<br/>audit, compaction, or archival"]:::memory
    EXTRACT --> TRIAGE
    TRIAGE --> HEUR["corebase-specharness/memories/repo/<br/>learned-heuristics.md"]:::memory
    TRIAGE --> PKB["corebase-specharness/memories/repo/<br/>project-knowledge-base.md"]:::memory
    TRIAGE --> DOMAIN["corebase-specharness/memories/domain/&lt;name&gt;/<br/>patterns and boundaries"]:::external
    TRIAGE --> POLICY["corebase-specharness/memories/repo/<br/>core-policies.md"]:::gate

    ROUTES["corebase-specharness/references/context-routes.yaml<br/>named-route source declarations"]:::core
    LOAD["skill-enter / context-load / context-explain<br/>bounded route compilation at runtime"]:::core
    ROUTES --> LOAD
    HEUR -.->|included only when declared| LOAD
    PKB -.->|included only when declared| LOAD
    DOMAIN -.->|included only when declared| LOAD
    POLICY -.->|included only when declared| LOAD
    LOAD -.->|selected context and local evidence| AN

    REV -.->|requirements gap| SP
    REV -.->|design or task gap| PL

    classDef terminal fill:#111827,stroke:#111827,color:#fff
    classDef core fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#2563eb,color:#1e3a8a
    classDef gate fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#16a34a,color:#166534
    classDef decision fill:#fff7ed,stroke:#f59e0b,color:#78350f
    classDef optional fill:#f8fafc,stroke:#94a3b8,color:#475569,stroke-dasharray:4 3
    classDef external fill:#f0f9ff,stroke:#0ea5e9,color:#0c4a6e
    classDef memory fill:#faf5ff,stroke:#a855f7,color:#4c1d95

    class STATUS,AN,SP,PL,TK,ROUTES,LOAD core
    class CODE,REV,POLICY gate
    class PROOF decision
    class SESSION optional
    class DOMAIN external
    class EXTRACT,TRIAGE,HEUR,PKB memory
